@startuml
title Product Catalog Management - Step 6 - Product specification & Offering shift to active

skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor<<blackbox>> Black
  ParticipantFontColor<<blackbox>> White
}

actor Marketer
actor CatalogAdministrator
participant "EngagementManagement" as EM #purple
participant "ProductCatalogManagement" as PCM <<blackbox>>
participant "EventManager" as EventMgr #grey

== Product Specification ==

CatalogAdministrator -> EM : 130 admin is connecting to catalog app
EM -> PCM : 131 **TMF701 Process Flow** POST /processFlow\n(WelcomeCatalog, CatalogAdministrator)
activate PCM
PCM --> EM : 132 **TMF701** 201 Created\n(List of available actions CreateProductSpec,\nManageProductSpec, RetrieveNotification)

group Product Specification valid

    CatalogAdministrator -> EM : 133 Let's validate the Product Specification
    EM -> PCM : 134 **TMF701 Process Flow** POST /processFlow\n(ManageProductSpec, ProductSpecification#56, state active)

    PCM -> PCM : 135 **TMF620 Product Catalog Management**\nPATCH /productSpecification/id56\n(state active)

    PCM --> EM : 136 **TMF701** 201 Created\nProductSpecification #56 shifts to active

    PCM -> EventMgr : 137 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST /productSpecificationStateChangeEvent\n(ProductSpecification #56, state = active)

end
deactivate PCM

== Product Offering ==

Marketer -> EM : 138 marketer is connecting to catalog app
EM -> PCM : 139 **TMF701 Process Flow** POST /processFlow\n(WelcomeCatalog, marketer)
activate PCM
PCM --> EM : 140 **TMF701** 201 Created\n(List of available actions: Create ProductOffering,\nManage ProductOffering, Retrieve Notification,\nCreate POP, Manage POP, Test PO, Launch PO)

group Product offering valid !

    Marketer -> EM : 141 Let's validate the Product Offering
    EM -> PCM : 142 **TMF701 Process Flow** POST /processFlow\n(UpdateProductOffering, PO#569, state active)

    PCM -> PCM : 143 Check state change consistency for PO/PS/POP

    PCM -> PCM : 144 **TMF620 Product Catalog Management**\nPATCH /productOffering.id569\n(state active)

    PCM --> EM : 145 **TMF701** 201 Created\nProductOffering #569 shifts to active

    PCM -> EventMgr : 146 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST /productOfferingStateChangeEvent\n(PO #569, state = active)

end
deactivate PCM

@enduml
